    e2 = '---\ntitle: "Qingpu User Settings"\ndescription: "Theme-private user settings bucket for the Qingpu listing workbench"\n---\n\n# Qingpu User Settings API\n\nThis module provides a theme-private PostgreSQL settings bucket for the `qingpu` theme. It stores per-user workbench preferences in a single `qingpu_settings` table instead of scattering new global keys into APayShop\'s `settings` table.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Configure `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL` or reuse `DATABASE_URL`.\n2. Execute the SQL file at `app/themes/qingpu/database/settings.sql`.\n3. Call `/api/qingpu/listing/settings` from the listing workbench.\n\n## Storage Rules\n\n- Settings are isolated by `user_id`.\n- The root JSON document lives in `qingpu_settings.settings`.\n- Listing model preferences are currently stored under `listing.modelSettings`.\n- Future listing, collect, publish, or workflow preferences should continue to expand the same JSON bucket instead of creating one-off tables.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Get Listing Model Settings\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/settings`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "persisted": true,\n  "data": {\n    "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n    "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n    "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n    "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n    "imageGenQuality": "medium",\n    "imageProviderProfiles": [\n      {\n        "id": "imgp_demo",\n        "name": "HD Portrait",\n        "model": "gpt-image-1",\n        "size": "1024x1536",\n        "quality": "high"\n      }\n    ],\n    "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n    "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n    "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n    "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n    "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n    "commissionRate": 0.15,\n    "freightCny": 5,\n    "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n    "profitRate": 0.2,\n    "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n    "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n    "storageFeeRub": 0,\n    "storageMonths": 1,\n    "adBudgetRub": 0,\n    "adRate": 0,\n    "otherRate": 0.03,\n    "returnRate": 0.05,\n    "translationGlossary": [\n      { "source": "storage box", "target": "\u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043A\u0430 \u0434\u043B\u044F \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F" },\n      { "source": "thickened", "target": "\u0443\u0442\u043E\u043B\u0449\u0435\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0439" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- `persisted=true` means the current user has already saved a cloud copy.\n- `persisted=false` means the API is returning server defaults because no cloud record exists yet.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Save Listing Model Settings\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/settings`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n  "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n  "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n  "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n  "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n  "imageGenQuality": "high",\n  "imageProviderProfiles": [\n    {\n      "id": "imgp_demo",\n      "name": "HD Portrait",\n      "model": "gpt-image-1",\n      "size": "1024x1536",\n      "quality": "high"\n    }\n  ],\n  "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n  "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n  "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n  "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n  "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n  "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n  "commissionRate": 0.15,\n  "freightCny": 5,\n  "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n  "profitRate": 0.2,\n  "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n  "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n  "storageFeeRub": 0,\n  "storageMonths": 1,\n  "adBudgetRub": 0,\n  "adRate": 0,\n  "otherRate": 0.03,\n  "returnRate": 0.05,\n  "translationGlossary": [\n    { "source": "storage box", "target": "\u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043A\u0430 \u0434\u043B\u044F \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F" },\n    { "source": "thickened", "target": "\u0443\u0442\u043E\u043B\u0449\u0435\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0439" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Listing model settings saved successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "generalModelApiKey": "sk-live-xxxx",\n    "generalModelBaseUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",\n    "generalModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "imageModelName": "gpt-image-1",\n    "imageGenSize": "1008x1344",\n    "imageGenQuality": "high",\n    "imageProviderProfiles": [\n      {\n        "id": "imgp_demo",\n        "name": "HD Portrait",\n        "model": "gpt-image-1",\n        "size": "1024x1536",\n        "quality": "high"\n      }\n    ],\n    "activeImageProfileId": "imgp_demo",\n    "videoModelName": "veo-3-fast",\n    "videoGenQuality": "medium",\n    "translationModelName": "gpt-4.1-mini",\n    "offerIdPrefix": "QP",\n    "exchangeRate": 12.5,\n    "commissionRate": 0.15,\n    "freightCny": 5,\n    "domesticFeeCny": 2,\n    "profitRate": 0.2,\n    "frontDiscountRate": 0,\n    "priceRoundRule": "to9",\n    "storageFeeRub": 0,\n    "storageMonths": 1,\n    "adBudgetRub": 0,\n    "adRate": 0,\n    "otherRate": 0.03,\n    "returnRate": 0.05,\n    "translationGlossary": [\n      { "source": "storage box", "target": "\u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043A\u0430 \u0434\u043B\u044F \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F" },\n      { "source": "thickened", "target": "\u0443\u0442\u043E\u043B\u0449\u0435\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0439" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- `imageGenSize` supports: `auto`, `1008x1344`, `1024x1536`, `768x1024`, `1024x1024`, `1536x1024`\n- `imageGenQuality` and `videoGenQuality` support: `auto`, `low`, `medium`, `high`\n- `imageProviderProfiles` is optional and stores reusable image presets; `activeImageProfileId` points to the current preset\n- `offerIdPrefix`, `exchangeRate`, `commissionRate`, and related numeric fields store the default pricing inputs shared by Dash and the web settings page\n- `translationGlossary` stores user-managed fixed terminology and stays separate from the local runtime `translationMemory` cache\n- Empty model names are allowed and mean "fall back to the general model or future workflow defaults"\n';
