    n21 = '---\ntitle: "Qingpu \u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key"\ndescription: "Qingpu \u4E3B\u9898\u79C1\u6709\u7684\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 key \u7B7E\u53D1\u3001\u8F6E\u6362\u3001\u540A\u9500\u4E0E\u6821\u9A8C\u63A5\u53E3"\n---\n\n# Qingpu \u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key API\n\n\u672C\u6A21\u5757\u4E3A `qingpu` \u4E3B\u9898\u63D0\u4F9B\u4E86\u4E00\u5957\u79C1\u6709 PostgreSQL \u5B9E\u73B0\uFF0C\u7528\u4E8E\u7BA1\u7406\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 key\u3002\u5B83\u4E0D\u4F1A\u5411\u5168\u5C40 `server/db/schema.*` \u5199\u5165\u4EFB\u4F55\u989D\u5916\u8868\u7ED3\u6784\u3002\n\n## \u521D\u59CB\u5316\u6B65\u9AA4\n\n1. \u914D\u7F6E `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL`\uFF0C\u6216\u8005\u76F4\u63A5\u590D\u7528 `DATABASE_URL`\u3002\n2. \u6267\u884C `app/themes/qingpu/database/tenant_authorization_keys.sql` \u4E2D\u7684\u5EFA\u8868 SQL\u3002\n3. \u901A\u8FC7 `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/*` \u8C03\u7528\u5BF9\u5E94\u63A5\u53E3\u3002\n\n## \u5B58\u50A8\u7EA6\u5B9A\n\n- \u539F\u59CB API key \u53EA\u4F1A\u5728\u521B\u5EFA\u548C\u8F6E\u6362\u65F6\u8FD4\u56DE\u4E00\u6B21\u3002\n- \u6570\u636E\u5E93\u53EA\u4FDD\u5B58 `api_key_hash` \u4E0E `api_key_prefix`\uFF0C\u4E0D\u4FDD\u5B58\u660E\u6587\u5BC6\u94A5\u3002\n- `subscriptionId` \u7528\u4E8E\u5173\u8054 APayShop \u8BA2\u9605\uFF0C`subscriptionSnapshot` \u7528\u4E8E\u4FDD\u7559\u7B7E\u53D1\u65F6\u7684\u5957\u9910\u5FEB\u7167\u3002\n\n---\n\n## 1. \u83B7\u53D6\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key \u5217\u8868\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `GET`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u5DF2\u767B\u5F55\u7528\u6237\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": [\n    {\n      "id": 12,\n      "userId": 7,\n      "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n      "productId": 3,\n      "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n      "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n      "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n      "keyLabel": "production",\n      "apiKeyPreview": "qpk_live_bd30c7****************",\n      "status": "active",\n      "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n      "issuedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "lastUsedAt": null,\n      "revokedAt": null,\n      "revokedReason": null,\n      "meta": {\n        "env": "prod"\n      },\n      "subscriptionSnapshot": {\n        "productName": "Qingpu Pro",\n        "interval": "month"\n      },\n      "createdAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. \u521B\u5EFA\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `POST`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u5DF2\u767B\u5F55\u7528\u6237\n\n### \u8BF7\u6C42\u4F53\n\n```json\n{\n  "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n  "keyLabel": "production",\n  "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n  "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n  "meta": {\n    "env": "prod"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key created successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. \u83B7\u53D6\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key \u8BE6\u60C5\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/detail?id=12`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `GET`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u5DF2\u767B\u5F55\u7528\u6237\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. \u8F6E\u6362\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/rotate`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `POST`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u5DF2\u767B\u5F55\u7528\u6237\n\n### \u8BF7\u6C42\u4F53\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z"\n}\n```\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key rotated successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "active"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_71f2f31554ce3fd5..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. \u540A\u9500\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/revoke`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `POST`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u5DF2\u767B\u5F55\u7528\u6237\n\n### \u8BF7\u6C42\u4F53\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "reason": "Tenant offboarded"\n}\n```\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key revoked successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "revoked",\n    "revokedReason": "Tenant offboarded"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. \u6821\u9A8C\u79DF\u6237\u6388\u6743 Key\n\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u5730\u5740**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/verify`\n- **\u8BF7\u6C42\u65B9\u6CD5**: `POST`\n- **\u6743\u9650\u8981\u6C42**: \u65E0\u9700\u767B\u5F55\n\n### \u8BF7\u6C42\u4F53\n\n```json\n{\n  "apiKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8...",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team"\n}\n```\n\n### \u6210\u529F\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "valid": true,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### \u9519\u8BEF\u54CD\u5E94\n\n```json\n{\n  "statusCode": 401,\n  "message": "Tenant key has expired"\n}\n```\n';
